                      "settings": {
                        "title": "Made with purpose.<br>Built around people.",
                        "header_size": "h2"
                      },
                      "elements": [],
                      "widgetType": "heading"
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "2d160a98",
                      "elType": "widget",
                      "settings": {
                        "editor": "<p>ForgeLine Steel brings structural fabrication, welding, architectural metalwork, and installation into one clear service offering. We focus on the relationship between the drawing, the workshop, and the site.</p>"
                      },
                      "elements": [],
                      "widgetType": "text-editor"
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "74c6ebba",
                      "elType": "widget",
                      "settings": {
                        "editor": "<p>Our goal is straightforward: understand what a project needs, make decisions with care, and keep the work moving through open communication.</p>"
                      },
                      "elements": [],
                      "widgetType": "text-editor"
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "2ab6b2f9",
                      "elType": "widget",
                      "settings": {
                        "editor": "<p>ForgeLine Steel is a fictional business created for this WordPress coursework. The services and project studies demonstrate the proposed business offering.</p>",
